    narr:narration """On 20260720, QuillAshgrove reported that [the Kestrelwood spectrograph is calibrated at 88.4 MHz](narr:Expr_1ForgetLifecycleTargetReturn_1) and [holds across the full observing band](narr:Expr_1ForgetLifecycleTargetReturn_2), with the check run against the June reference plates. XenaExpertgh then structured this into a formal bullet summary: [a 'Key decisions:' header](narr:Expr_1ForgetLifecycleTargetReturn_3) followed by parallel entries naming [the instrument](narr:Expr_1ForgetLifecycleTargetReturn_4) and [the calibration figure with its verification basis](narr:Expr_1ForgetLifecycleTargetReturn_5). The cluster covers instrument identity, the specific frequency, and the verification method — but not observing results, scheduling, or any downstream science use of the calibrated instrument.""" ;
